flowchart TD
    A([User Query]) --> B

    B[Web Chat Interface\nHTML · CSS · JavaScript]
    B --> C

    C[Backend API / Chat Controller\nASP.NET Core · Rate limiter · Session management]
    C --> D

    D[Intent Routing + Service Detection\nKeyword scoring · Safety & scope guards · IsSmallTalk / IsCrisis]
    D --> E

    E[Conversation Memory Check\nlastService · pendingFlow · session turns]
    E --> F

    F{Decision: General Query\nor Specialist Workflow?}

    F -- General Query --> G
    F -- Specialist Workflow --> H

    subgraph RAG ["RAG Pipeline"]
        G[RAG Pipeline\nLangChain · LLM orchestration]
        G --> G2[Embeddings + Retrieval\nTop-k cosine similarity · Vector store]
        G2 --> G3[LangChain + LLM\nContext-grounded generation]
    end

    subgraph SW ["Specialist Workflow"]
        H[Specialist Workflow\nBins · Housing · Schools · Nearby · Appt]
        H --> H2[Panels / Tools / Logic\nPlaywright · OS Places · Rule-based]
        H2 --> H3[Structured Service Response\nTyped reply + next steps URL]
    end

    G3 --> R
    H3 --> R

    R[Response Assembly Layer\nreply · service · suggestions · nextStepsUrl · score]
    R --> Z

    Z([Chatbot Response to User\nRendered in Web Chat Interface])
